 jardins privatifs. Des places de stationnement et des prestations de standing concourent au sentiment de bien-être de cette résidence entièrement sécurisée.","addr":"75 boulevard Richelieu","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjQ3N2E5MzQ5ODI5YzIwZGMyZTA3ODY0ZWQ0ZjI4NjUyNmVjMTkxNzgiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIzMzhiMDNhZmE1NWE1OTc5MzQyNjIzMzZhN2RkNjAzZiJ9?signature=d1869c2f88a7d70d9251ccbf8915d7f2fd100815a256acb01579a3fb5aea659a","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjVkNGFjYWI0MjBjN2MxOWI1NGZhODgzY2ZkOWNjNzhkNDdkZGFkYTEiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJmZGQxNjg2ZDgzYzYzN2NhNGQwNDVmZjE5MjVlMTk4ZCJ9?signature=aff0119fb942f2b37ff72aa85c358fe69ec2b596bb7a47548af29a73cb90caa5","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImY4MTQ4NDNlMWI0Njc3OTUzMDc5ZTk2MjllNGU3MDFhOWYxNDgyOTIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI3MzI1ZTQ2YzhiOWU5Y2NlNWRlYjFmOGVlYTgzNzhkMyJ9?signature=3e0b2bad07ee2a888e0b9d540d6f228a3bc9e8e9c5604bb1a76cd0d7db2e4c3c","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImM3N2FiMjdiOWNjZjhmMDIxNjcwMmM3ZTMxNmUwZGJmOWU0NzYwMmMiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI2ZDRmYzY1Njg1NGQzZWQzMjg3ZmM3ZDExMWNjYjg2NSJ9?signature=3e3c766de54c5aa5fffd48916a3a6b05fcb0125e21b84e2eac528f301a79d86e","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjEwYjQyNThhYzAyNDI4ZTNhMzY5MjAzNzliZDFiN2NhMWExODVhYTIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIwNTAwN2MxZWM0OTQ3YTNjYzkxYzU1NjE3NDBlNDNjNSJ9?signature=6526096452b63